      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Immanuel Lutheran School is located in Perryville, Missouri. It is a private school that serves 211 students in grades PK and K-8. Immanuel Lutheran School is coed and is affiliated with the Lutheran Church–Missouri Synod.",
