    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Trinity Lutheran School is a Lutheran school in Orlando, Florida caring for children from infancy through 8th grade. The school is a ministry of Trinity Lutheran Church and has served the community in Downtown Orlando since 1953. Trinity Lutheran School is a fully accredited school as recognized by the National Lutheran School Accreditation of the Lutheran Church–Missouri Synod. and Southern Association of Colleges and Schools.",
      "depth": 0,
